   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "title: \"How to Run\"\n",
    "format: html\n",
    "editor: visual\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "This will be a fast guide on how to run the federeated environment step by step.\n",
    "\n",
    "## What do you need\n",
    "\n",
    "In order to make everything work properly you shuold:\n",
    "  - Install R\n",
    "  - Install Docker\n",
    "  - Download for our GitHub repo (https://github.com/FAIRVASC/federated/main) the Federated_Learning directory\n",
    "\n",
    "## SQL\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 1\n",
    "Open your shell, move into the Federated_Learning directory and create the password for the user-master communication and for the master-slave communication\n",
    "\n",
    "```{bash pw, eval=FALSE}\n",
    "export FAIRVASC_APP_PASSWORD='fairvasc'\n",
    "export FAIRVASC_WORKER_PASSWORD='worker'\n",
    "```\n",
    "## SPARQL"
   ]
  }
